# WW: Stealth Boys and the robots' built-in gear.

stealth-boy-activated = { CAPITALIZE(THE($item)) } hums, and you fade from view.
stealth-boy-deactivated = Your cloak flickers out.
stealth-boy-already-active = You're already cloaked.
stealth-boy-recharging = It doesn't have enough charge yet.

laser-eye-charging = Your laser eye is still charging.
laser-eye-ready = Laser eye charged. Fire to release the beam.
laser-eye-cooling = Your laser eye is cooling down ({ $seconds }s).

robot-sounds-muted = You switch your speaker off. You'll make no sounds.
robot-sounds-unmuted = You switch your speaker back on.

fusion-core-detonate-no-core = There's no fusion core in you to detonate.
fusion-core-detonate-started = FUSION CORE OVERLOAD. DETONATION IMMINENT.
